     "text": "def has_cycle(head: Optional[Node]) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Determines if a linked list has a cycle using the Floyd's Tortoise and Hare algorithm.\n    \n    Args:\n        head: The head node of the linked list.\n        \n    Returns:\n        True if the linked list contains a cycle, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not head or not head.next:\n        return False\n    \n    slow = head\n    fast = head.next\n    \n    while fast and fast.next:\n        if slow == fast:\n            return True\n        slow = slow.next\n        fast = fast.next.next\n    \n    return False",
